Subject: [PATCH 1827/3799] soh: rename func_809AA0EC ->
 EffectSsKakera_UpdateAccel

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: clears the acceleration, measures the offset from the origin and runs the force passes in order, giving up once the fragment is more than 1000 units away.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/effects/ovl_Effect_Ss_Kakera/z_eff_ss_kakera.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 .../overlays/effects/ovl_Effect_Ss_Kakera/z_eff_ss_kakera.c  | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/effects/ovl_Effect_Ss_Kakera/z_eff_ss_kakera.c b/soh/src/overlays/effects/ovl_Effect_Ss_Kakera/z_eff_ss_kakera.c
index cda10028d..d0252044e 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/effects/ovl_Effect_Ss_Kakera/z_eff_ss_kakera.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/effects/ovl_Effect_Ss_Kakera/z_eff_ss_kakera.c
@@ -317,7 +317,8 @@ s32 EffectSsKakera_ApplyGravity(EffectSs* this, Vec3f* diff, f32 dist) {
     return 1;
 }
 
-s32 func_809AA0EC(EffectSs* this) {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_809AA0EC: clears the acceleration, measures the offset from the origin and runs the force passes in order, giving up once the fragment is more than 1000 units away.
+s32 EffectSsKakera_UpdateAccel(EffectSs* this) {
     Vec3f diff;
     f32 dist;
 
@@ -421,7 +422,7 @@ void EffectSsKakera_Update(PlayState* play, u32 index, EffectSs* this) {
 
     EffectSsKakera_UpdateRotation(this);  // was func_809A9C10 [LLM:HIGH]
 
-    if (!func_809AA0EC(this)) {
+    if (!EffectSsKakera_UpdateAccel(this)) {  // was func_809AA0EC [LLM:HIGH]
         this->life = 0;
     }
 
